ect  two possible lymph nodes are identified  each measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections from the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections adjacent to cavity  blue stained fibrous parenchyma    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior margin closest to cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unremarkable surrounding breast parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Two possible lymph nodes  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary lymph node   is a 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm aggregate of fat containing three blue lymph nodes  The entire specimen is frozen as FX 1  which is now submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA   SENTINEL  BIOPSY  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Gross Dictation by Anita Deshpande  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Elena F Brachtel M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA   SENTINEL    EXCISION PART C  CRYOSTAT FROZEN SECTION  SLIDE ONLY  , Unchecked.
