IN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  15 MAY 93 at 13 25 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab in two parts  Labeled  Left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm piece of soft  yellow tissue  Sectioning reveals unremarkable breast parenchyma  No frozen section done  Submitted entirely in A through C  Labeled  Left breast mass  is a 5 x 2 x 1cm piece of tissue with a localizing wire  Adjacent to the wire is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm poorly defined  white  fibrous  stellate area that focally extends to the inked margin  A piece is frozen as Frozen Section  1 and saved frozen  The remaining portion of tumor is submitted in D and G  The remaining tissue is submitted entirely in E and F  Resident  George O  Kucyj  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   2 LEFT BREAST MASS  INFILTRATING AND INTRADUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Jay Austen  MD O R  Diagnosis by  John O Connell  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART A  LEFT BREAST MASS PART B  LEFT BREAST MASS   report_end  , Unchecked.
