ary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  28 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 15 51 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast duct stitch marks proximal duct  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm portion of the breast is an attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm duct  designating proximal   The specimen is inked as follows  The proximal half is inked black and the distal half is inked blue  The specimen is serially sectioned from proximal to distal to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm tan brown irregular mass continuous with the duct which comes to within 0 2cm of the most distal margin of the specimen and extends to the proximal surface  Section Code  A C  duct  proximal to distal  proximal margin in A D T  The entire specimen with F and G  bisected H and I  the longest axis of the lesion  J and K bisected  L and M bisected  N and O bisected P R trisected  T with the most distal portion of the specimen  Resident  ARASH RADFAR  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Steven Michael Abbate  M D  Vivian M Sanchez  M D  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT DUCT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
