ace  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin lateral  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm portion of pink yellow fibroadipose tissue with a pink red shaggy surface on one side  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a yellow tan fatty unremarkable cut surface  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL NODE  HOT AND BLUE   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Gross Dictation by Matthew M Johnson M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Matthew M Johnson M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA   SENTINEL    EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  LEFT ADDITIONAL DEEP TISSUE   EXCISION PART E  BREAST  LEFT ADDITIONAL SUPERIOR MEDIAL TISSUE   EXCISION PART F  BREAST  LEFT ADDITIONAL INFERIOR TISSUE   E , Unchecked.
