 by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  30 MAY 01 at 15 54 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is an oriented right modified radical mastectomy specimen  consisting of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm breast with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm axillary tail  oriented with a short suture marking superior and long suture lateral  A REMOVED_DATE x 14 5cm irregular shaped  nipple bearing skin is present anteriorly  The nipple is unremarkable  There is a 6 0cm linear hypertrophic scar  0 7cm from the superior margin and 15 0cm from the nipple  Also on the skin surface  there is REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm superficial erosion  lined by tan brown granulation tissue  and surrounded by tan red firm hyperemic skin  11 0cm from the nipple  A REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm focal area surrounding the surface erosion is firm and irregularly nodular  The specimen is inked in black at the deep margin  and blue anteriorly  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a irregularly shaped  light tan fibrotic mass  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm directly subjacent to the skin erosion  The fibrotic mass contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm cavity with tan red luminal necrotic tissue  and comes within 1 5cm of the deep margin  black   1 0cm of the anterior margin  blue  and 2 8cm of the superior margin  A separate biopsy cavity REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm lined by light tan irregular surface  surrounded by firm fibrous tissue  immediately adjacent to the fibrotic mass mentioned earlier  and subjacent to the healed scar  The cavity comes within 1 5cm of the deep margin  2 0cm of both superior and ant