rrhage  The remaining parenchyma shows fibrofatty tissue  The nipple is unremarkable  Section code  A  biopsy cavity  deep margin B G  representative sections of biopsy cavity and surrounding firm white mass H  representative section of biopsy cavity in relation to overlying skin I  representative section of more fibrous breast away from biopsy cavity  J M  representative sections of tissue in area of glistening membrane adjacent to anterior margin of old axillary dissection  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
